{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚（2日）TVB節目《璀璨之城》劇情極度緊張，張智霖為威逼高海寧竟捉走其母親，更以魔鬼式演技瘋狂挑釁！高海寧瞬間崩潰，激動得淚流滿面並持筷子企圖插向對方頸部，場面張力十足。究竟二人對峙結果如何？\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖魔鬼上身挑釁 高海寧崩潰爆喊</h2>\n<p>在昨晚播出的劇情中，孝賢（張智霖飾）為了逼使Alice（高海寧飾）繼續為他效力，竟卑鄙地捉走其母親芬姨（王綺琴飾）。在這段僅約分半鐘的對峙戲中，當Alice得知母親被擄後，一向冷靜的她馬上情緒失控，含淚質問孝賢：「你捉咗阿媽去邊呀？」豈料孝賢竟一臉無辜地玩弄她。情急之下，Alice折斷筷子撲向孝賢，但徹底黑化的孝賢不但毫無懼色，更咬牙切齒地以「大細聲」瘋狂挑釁：「（輕聲）插落嚟我哋一齊去見阿媽」、「（重語氣）插落嚟呀，（輕聲）你都唔係第一次㗎啦！」被刺激至極點的Alice最終完全崩潰，奮力將筷子插向孝賢頸部，但在最後一刻還是無法下手，只能跌坐地上抱頭痛哭：「我做唔到，我真係做唔到。」</p>\n<h2>高海寧拍到情緒失控 嚇窒張智霖：你別過來</h2>\n<p>為了讓高海寧飾演的內斂角色更具層次感，劇組特意設計了這場演技大爆發的戲份。據悉，由於場口難度極高，為了呈現最佳效果，劇組當日試位連拍攝至少超過十次。全程投入的高海寧，在拍攝完畢後情緒激動得久久未能平伏。她早前受訪時透露，當時張智霖拍完後想上前安慰她，但她卻嚇得大叫：「你別過來！」高海寧亦在訪問中感激張智霖的幫助：「當時Chilam好好，佢試咗唔同嘅說話方式去刺激我，令到我嘅情緒由1秒瞬間升到100。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式激讚張智霖 封神級演技力推封帝</h2>\n<p>這段短暫的對手戲播出後，立即被網民封為《璀璨之城》的名場面之一，並引發洗版式好評，大讚張智霖與高海寧的演技「有來有往」，火花四濺。特別是張智霖的「惡魔演技」，更為他贏得極高呼聲，不少網民力推他成為今屆視帝。網民紛紛留言激讚：「大少給的精神折磨不下於家暴」、「兩個的表情都很絕」、「張智霖只要出場就很炸裂，很有張力」、「超絕演技，太能代入了」、「很喜歡這樣的張智霖」、「好嚇人，讓人頭皮發麻」、「張智霖演技高光時刻全在《璀璨》」、「反覆觀看，張智霖演技不得了」、「眼神和聲音都好可怕」、「張智霖演技絕了，高Ling也接住了，就得有來有往才精彩。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_4690477086ae98270ac032.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_4690477086ae98270ac032.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15719612776ae98273eaf7b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15719612776ae98273eaf7b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_4685951076ae9827a6159f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_4685951076ae9827a6159f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1115442826ae9827ce1b3b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1115442826ae9827ce1b3b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_4157805936ae982836960c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_4157805936ae982836960c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_20457009966ae9828638839.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_20457009966ae9828638839.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2599328636ae9828a0a8a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2599328636ae9828a0a8a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21211535626ae9828d036b6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21211535626ae9828d036b6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_12386209376ae982910487b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_12386209376ae982910487b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_13458515836ae9829434ad7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_13458515836ae9829434ad7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_11466893846ae9829709eff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_11466893846ae9829709eff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14114988936ae982a0052a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14114988936ae982a0052a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14320550396ae982a2e4c4e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14320550396ae982a2e4c4e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:02:48.041703+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1287,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:30:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:03.405873+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:03.405873+00:00","content_hash":"ade9b0c5be22ffeb561db702e879f7c22991be0c326a345d6694e278adbfd395","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}